## What is not here

The problem library the server grades against is **not** in this repository.
`tools/build_content.py` reads an upstream `coding_platform.db` produced by the
Python-practice-platform project and writes the `content.db` the server serves.
That upstream database is not redistributed here, and neither is the reference
solution set: `content.db` stores reference solutions in a table that a
read-only `ContentStore` is refused by a SQLite authorizer, so the running
server cannot hand them out even to a signed-in student. See
[`docs/CONTENT_BUILD.md`](docs/CONTENT_BUILD.md) and
[`docs/CONTENT_VERIFICATION.md`](docs/CONTENT_VERIFICATION.md).
